\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Around the throne of God in heaven 
\par Thousands of children stand,
\par Children, whose sins are all forgiven,
\par A holy, happy band,
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Singing: Glory, glory, glory!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. In flowing robes of spotless white
\par See every one arrayed,
\par Dwelling in everlasting light
\par And joys that never fade.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Singing: Glory, glory, glory!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. What brought them to that world 
\par above,
\par That heaven so bright and fair,
\par Where all is peace, and joy, and love?
\par How came those children there?
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Singing: Glory, glory, glory!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Because the Saviour shed His blood
\par To wash away their sin;
\par Bathed in that pure and precious flood,
\par Behold them white and clean.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Singing: Glory, glory, glory!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. On earth they sought the Saviour's
\par grace,
\par On earth they loved His name;
\par So now they see His blessed face,
\par And stand before the Lamb.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Singing: Glory, glory, glory!
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

